---
description: NutriVision architecture and development conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow the root `AGENTS.md` before making any change. It is the
canonical source of truth for this Flutter project. Preserve Clean Architecture
by feature, real Bloc for shared workflows, Cubit only for small local state,
RepositoryProvider-based dependency injection, thin screens, reusable feature
widgets, the existing floating/transparent UI composition, and the required
format/analyze/test checks. When implementing a feature, proactively add
contextual `AppToast` feedback for meaningful success, failure, validation,
and unavailable-action paths.
